OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist, 21, dies after
OL,4,Athree-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died following a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FPolice were called to the B1062 Flixton
OL,10,FRoad in Bungay, Suffolk, just before
OL,11,F15:45 BST on Thursday.
OL,13,FThe fire service and paramedics were
OL,14,Falso called to the crash that involved
OL,15,Fan HGV lorry, a Volvo box van and a
OL,16,FYamaha motorcycle.
OL,18,FThe rider of the motorcycle, identified
OL,19,Fas 21-year-old Connor Young from
OL,20,FBrampton, was airlifted to Norfolk and
OL,21,FNorwich University Hospital where he
OL,22,Fdied on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
